@startuml
title cmp - Statistics source dependencies
component "Entry point\nmain.cpp" as Entry
component "CLI\ncli.hpp / cli.cpp" as CLI
component "Computation\nstatistics.hpp / statistics.cpp" as Core
Entry ..> CLI : calls run
CLI ..> Core : uses Statistics\ncalls compute_statistics
note bottom of CLI
  parse_values and run are free functions.
  Streams are borrowed at the boundary.
end note
note bottom of Core
  Pure numeric calculation.
  No dependency on CLI or streams.
end note
@enduml
